{
  "name": "Lead intake and qualification",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lead intake and qualification\nA website form posts to the webhook. The lead is normalised and de-duplicated by an idempotency key, classified by an LLM into a fixed schema, scored by plain rules and routed by tier.\n\n- **hot**: Slack alert + Gmail reply draft\n- **warm**: nurture reply draft\n- **cold**: CRM row only\n\nReplies are saved as drafts for a person to send. Every lead lands in the CRM sheet first.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "fa8c4429-3e06-528b-8bbd-abb7ea56ab41",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "lead-intake",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "343c7e7a-25d1-5bdb-97cb-28555b9b0ec1",
      "name": "Lead webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "93c42669-4f0f-56f9-a316-57db2b542c67"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Normalise the form payload and derive an idempotency key, so a resubmitted form is processed once.\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const b = item.json.body || {};\n  const email = String(b.email || '').trim().toLowerCase();\n  const message = String(b.message || '').trim();\n  // FNV-1a 32-bit hash of email + message: dependency-free and stable across runs\n  let h = 0x811c9dc5;\n  for (const ch of `${email}|${message.toLowerCase()}`) {\n    h ^= ch.charCodeAt(0);\n    h = Math.imul(h, 0x01000193) >>> 0;\n  }\n  out.push({\n    json: {\n      name: String(b.name || '').trim(),\n      email,\n      company: String(b.company || '').trim(),\n      company_size: Number(b.company_size) || 0,\n      budget_usd: Number(b.budget_usd) || 0,\n      source: String(b.source || 'website'),\n      message,\n      submitted_at: String(b.submitted_at || ''),\n      idempotency_key: `lead_${h.toString(16).padStart(8, '0')}`,\n    },\n  });\n}\nreturn out;\n"
      },
